# The local stack's environment. `.env.ci` holds throwaway values for an
# ephemeral stack and IS committed; this one holds the machine's own.
.env

# The generated Prisma client. It is generated on every build — `prisma
# generate` — and it is part of the build, so `tsc` checks it. Committing it
# would mean committing a file that is never the truth.
src/generated/
